                                                "text": "We have quite a playful and fun relationship in general, but it’s still surprising how dirty our sex can be in the things we say or do or pretend. We often laugh about it afterwards."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5c05fa53-11da-384a-987f-270a03b5344f",
